> form content/sample quests.toml watch_oath
quests.toml › watch_oath: The Watch's Oath
Identity
  Name · name = The Watch's Oath
  Giver · giver = city_watch (ashen_circle, brother_ash, captain_hale, city_watch, free_company, lantern_guild, merchant_ava, player, sister_mira, temple or vex)
Requirements
  Requirements › Needs not to be in lantern_guild · requires.not_member[0] (ashen_circle, city_watch, free_company, lantern_guild or temple)
  + Requirement: Done, Member of, Not a member of, Rank at least, Standing or Within tolerance of
Stages
  Stage "patrol" › Id · stages[0].id = patrol
  Stage "patrol" › Choice "report" › Id · stages[0].choices[0].id = report
  Stage "patrol" › Choice "report" › Outcome · stages[0].choices[0].outcome = turned_in_vex (fenced_the_crown_jewels, fined_by_watch, rescued_merchant, sowed_discord, took_a_bribe or turned_in_vex)
  Stage "patrol" › Choice "report" › Next · stages[0].choices[0].next = oath
  Stage "patrol" › Choice "look_away" › Id · stages[0].choices[1].id = look_away
  Stage "patrol" › Choice "look_away" › Outcome · stages[0].choices[1].outcome = took_a_bribe (fenced_the_crown_jewels, fined_by_watch, rescued_merchant, sowed_discord, took_a_bribe or turned_in_vex)
  Stage "patrol" › Choice "look_away" › Next · stages[0].choices[1].next = end
  # Swearing in is the oath; joining the Watch is the character's own act, never a
  # quest's (D-30).
  Stage "oath" › Id · stages[1].id = oath
  Stage "oath" › Requirements › Needs standing 10.0 with The City Watch · stages[1].requires.standing.city_watch
  Stage "oath" › Choice "swear" › Id · stages[1].choices[0].id = swear
  Stage "oath" › Choice "swear" › Effects › Moves law by 5.0 · stages[1].choices[0].effects.alignment.law
  Stage "oath" › Choice "swear" › Next · stages[1].choices[0].next = end
  + Stage
